1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,220
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:10,700
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say customer, instead say client - because people clients

3
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:15,010
feel like partners, customers feel like numbers.

4
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:20,880
Don't say buy, instead say invest - people invest in value, not purchases.

5
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:27,080
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

6
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,250
one-sided.

7
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:35,380
Don't say problem, instead say concern - concerns get solved, problems get blamed.

8
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:41,460
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - authorizing feels like a choice, not a trap.

9
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:45,740
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

